			"notes": "## BepHax Final\n\n**⚠️ FINAL FREE RELEASE**\n\nThis is the last free version of BepHax. Future updates will be paid only.\n\n### Requirements\n- Minecraft 1.21.11\n- Fabric Loader 0.18.2+\n- Meteor Client 1.21.11-SNAPSHOT\n\n### Installation\n1. Download `BepHax-Final.jar`\n2. Place in your `mods` folder\n3. Launch with Fabric + Meteor Client\n\n**Discord:** [discord.gg/EGEhHNSkV8](https://discord.gg/EGEhHNSkV8)\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/dekrom/BepHaxAddon/commits/vFinal"
		},
