			"notes": "-Updated to 1.21.10 Meteor Client.\n-Upgraded Gradle.\n-Added LiveMessage (https://github.com/rebane2001/livemessage) port as a module.\n-Added ChestTracker module.\n-Improved ItemSearchBar (Now highlight contents on Item Frames and ChestTracker Implementation).\n-Improved MobInfo Hud.\n-Removed unused classes and fixed GUI changes for 1.2.10.\n-Fixed BepMine kicking you when instamining.\n-Added HotbarTotem module.\n-Removed Capes and Glowing.\n\n<img width=\"617\" height=\"512\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ce1a173d-377b-4432-b5a9-16ddc1d55cde\" />\n<img width=\"810\" height=\"675\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b75b21c1-2d9d-42d3-ab2a-e724ad60d2ff\" />"
